{"id":5331,"date":"2025-08-30T15:26:16","date_gmt":"2025-08-30T08:26:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5331"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:16:17","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:16:17","slug":"cach-dang-ky-tai-khoan-amazon-kindle","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/cach-dang-ky-tai-khoan-amazon-kindle\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Kindle chi ti\u1ebft"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"P2sIdLAzioKVqzxD8OklILkIgFh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPygdpxmTo4JzVx3CcZlNPfEgKd\">Trong th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi s\u1ed1, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i h\u01a1n bao gi\u1edd h\u1ebft nh\u1edd c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, v\u00e0 Amazon Kindle ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 c\u00e1i t\u00ean d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u xu h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u00e0y. Vi\u1ec7c s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Kindle l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf ra m\u1ed9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n tri th\u1ee9c kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 ngay trong t\u1ea7m tay.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZG6di1AMojQYDxCq0xl8nFlgog\">B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y c\u1ee7a <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft, t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JKKtdZA1IokkNyxdMShlaum2gZf\">Amazon Kindle l\u00e0 g\u00ec v\u00e0 T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n?<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;72ea8970-4f7b-4656-80dc-d2bde1eba515&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKoSTb8mjkoPjxNxjMdIloedIgSh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KoSTb8mjkoPjxNxjMdIloedIgSh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:389371,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5332\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5332\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5332\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471.png\" alt=\"Amazon Kindle l\u00e0 g\u00ec v\u00e0 T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f11a339e-9415-4310-a2e6-cfbf75d60471-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5332\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Amazon Kindle l\u00e0 g\u00ec v\u00e0 T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P2sIdLAzioKVqzxD8OklILkIgFh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HlNvdxzKwoUkAjx4xlxl3aklg8g\"><strong>Amazon Kindle<\/strong> l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed (ebook) \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1edfi Amazon, g\u00e3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb m\u00e1y \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng mang th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Kindle v\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Kindle mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed tr\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Evr5dilJ4oWTrLxwPVYlO7F7gBh\">Vi\u1ec7c s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Kindle mang l\u1ea1i r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UNgid23YNoIL06xOW7nlFEYOgad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Truy c\u1eadp th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n s\u00e1ch kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ea7u s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb kh\u1eafp n\u01a1i tr\u00ean th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, bao g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng cu\u1ed1n s\u00e1ch m\u1edbi ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh, s\u00e1ch b\u00e1n ch\u1ea1y v\u00e0 v\u00f4 s\u1ed1 s\u00e1ch mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SyjRd5xJQokL4SxqCyEltM3Pgih\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb:<\/strong> Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch tr\u00ean m\u00e1y \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch Kindle, \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng minh, m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1ea3ng ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n th\u00f4ng qua \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Kindle.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLOLdrSNqobRT5xDTPFlEOseggc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 h\u00f3a ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ecdc:<\/strong> Kindle s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i trang s\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n \u0111ang \u0111\u1ecdc d\u1edf. D\u00f9 b\u1ea1n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb n\u00e0o, b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ecdc ngay t\u1ea1i v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u00e3 d\u1eebng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WUEPd0JRZoypaExFZQalyC7sgAb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng gian:<\/strong> S\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 r\u1ebb h\u01a1n s\u00e1ch gi\u1ea5y v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian v\u1eadt l\u00fd n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n cu\u1ed1n s\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BscddlikfoUHm3xymK2lkPgegqc\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch. N\u00f3 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3, bao g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 vi\u1ec7c tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng c\u1ea1nh tranh. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n mu\u1ed1n khai th\u00e1c c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i n\u00e0y m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n, vi\u1ec7c c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh l\u00e0 r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng. C\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> cung c\u1ea5p <strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cho \u0111\u1ebfn x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean Amazon.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CHomd2mnVoLnqixSwxplRYshgdg\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb g\u00ec tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;50050fbc-853b-4c69-a8e0-767d088244c0&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FD8mabiLs3o4s0CxdxpQlFZsXgqc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;D8mabiLs3o4s0CxdxpQlFZsXgqc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:276267,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;50050fbc-853b-4c69-a8e0-767d088244c0&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FD8mabiLs3o4s0CxdxpQlFZsXgqc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;D8mabiLs3o4s0CxdxpQlFZsXgqc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:276267,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5333\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5333\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5333\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2.png\" alt=\"Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb g\u00ec tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/df028794-03a2-440e-b370-926209be91f2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5333\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb g\u00ec tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P2sIdLAzioKVqzxD8OklILkIgFh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRPedLwtko1AIqx5nhyl8qUUgff\">Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd r\u1ea5t nhanh ch\u00f3ng. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i th\u00f4ng tin c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LENTddXfRoY3gHxza8AlxXBxgzc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn m\u00e3 x\u00e1c minh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IykddHAn5ohziUxE7H9l67f9gnc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i (t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn nh\u01b0ng khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch):<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MtvfdROiAokqONxr2KHlkDABg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf (Credit\/Debit Card):<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00f4ng b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd, nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn n\u00f3 n\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n mua s\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 Kindle Unlimited.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MUUAdlGgkoTEU1x58C3l4sUmgVe\">H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn \u0110\u0103ng K\u00fd T\u00e0i Kho\u1ea3n Amazon Chi Ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AfVqdky4EoZlEIxxqU1lNUGFgNY\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Kindle ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y. N\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a, h\u00e3y l\u00e0m theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc sau:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ra5od6UKlojZ6Nxzcctl0bx8gOe\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp trang \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd Amazon<\/strong> M\u1edf tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t web v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a Amazon t\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.amazon.com<\/a><\/strong>. Di chu\u1ed9t v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;Account &amp; Lists&#8221;<\/strong> v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn <strong>&#8220;Start here.&#8221;<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YTGldKpPUosiXDxTSIIl6Ersg4f\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-galle