li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SqjKdhwyKooxoCx1dailFgsxgUf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e1c minh email<\/strong> Amazon s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t m\u00e3 OTP (One-Time Password) g\u1ed3m 6 ch\u1eef s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email b\u1ea1n v\u1eeba \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd. H\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra h\u1ed9p th\u01b0 \u0111\u1ebfn, sao ch\u00e9p m\u00e3 OTP \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0 nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o \u00f4 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u00ean trang web c\u1ee7a Amazon, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n <strong>&#8220;Verify&#8221;<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DYpsdZch4oJdqExxCDJlVgJFg0f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u00eam s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i (T\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn)<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt, Amazon s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n th\u00eam s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam ngay ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecf qua b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y. N\u1ebfu th\u00eam, b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n x\u00e1c minh b\u1eb1ng m\u00e3 OTP \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UnwrdHhzsoUIlixw38KlVcprgob\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6a011dd2-b250-49e7-a6d2-4fe0c601a627&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJ6eobyN1ZoNLwIxQCZklqoAlgXc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;J6eobyN1ZoNLwIxQCZklqoAlgXc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:388935,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div clas