u1ec7n t\u1eed.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ipm3dIoD8oMSGExJaN6lj19FgSb\"><strong>\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng\/thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb Kindle<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MqjhdAmE4ooAsMxCcb8lD5sLgKc\">T\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Kindle mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i\/m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1ea3ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, ho\u1eb7c m\u1edf m\u00e1y \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch Kindle l\u00ean. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng email v\u00e0 m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u b\u1ea1n v\u1eeba t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-GPVnd2oPzodQqBxC7ySliW78gAI\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bc2b048f-1c6f-46de-b6f4-9073a07b7a24&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKJZkbSywwokd7IxossIladk4gJb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KJZkbSywwokd7IxossIladk4gJb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:483807,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bc2b048f-1c6f-46de-b6f4-9073a07b7a24&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKJZkbSywwokd7IxossIladk4gJb%2F%3Fpreview_ty