<strong>&#8220;Your Payments&#8221;<\/strong> v\u00e0 th\u00eam th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng\/ghi n\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-KFJ9dPp7hoYIQvxuoB1lKPkaggh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;15bf6f46-077b-4efc-8773-60621528bd60&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FC8cYbWHlXoaMEhxokTMlRnzsgvb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;C8cYbWHlXoaMEhxokTMlRnzsgvb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:389432,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;15bf6f46-077b-4efc-8773-60621528bd60&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FC8cYbWHlXoaMEhxokTMlRnzsgvb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;C8cYbWHlXoaMEhxokTMlRnzsgvb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:389432,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5334\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5334\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5334\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng\/thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb Kindle\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/bb7bac54-44f2-45a4-aa9e-52d35b7dc2f3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5334\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng\/thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb Kindle<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P2sIdLAzioKVqzxD8OklILkIgFh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AG0Hdv5hGoDcyoxKQpJlXgRegag\"><strong>T\u1ea3i s\u00e1ch mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGxudG1e1o0QWYxjQx4lDOupgbb\">\u0110\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ngay, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u1edbi t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a <strong>&#8220;free kindle books&#8221;<\/strong> tr\u00ean Amazon. C\u00f3 h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7u s\u00e1ch kinh \u0111i\u1ec3n v\u00e0 s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb c\u00e1c t\u00e1c gi\u1ea3 m\u1edbi mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed \u0111ang ch\u1edd b\u1ea1n kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-NFcEdLtLMo3dN0xWt3Kl6ny8glg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dbb2bed8-0bb6-47d7-8ca9-ae52e39d3998&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUBF0bCyqeo4TvnxE8MkllIi3gs7%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UBF0bCyqeo4TvnxE8MkllIi3gs7&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:717033,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dbb2bed8-0bb6-47d7-8ca9-ae52e39d3998&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUBF0bCyqeo4TvnxE8MkllIi3gs7%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UBF0bCyqeo4TvnxE8MkllIi3gs7&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:717033,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5338\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5338\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5338\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea3i s\u00e1ch mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/60d24341-57d2-465a-aaf0-e294cfc94da1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5338\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea3i s\u00e1ch mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"P2sIdLAzioKVqzxD8OklILkIgFh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KgurdUZG9o0ZAYx6Bqkl2GjDgwg\">C\u00e1c C\u00e2u H\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LOJtdFhYVooKlAxuH6sl3dhqgUg\"><strong>T\u00f4i c\u00f3 c\u1ea7n m\u00e1y Kindle \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Skn1dD0CYob0s2xLqgBluM0tgWb\">Kh\u00f4ng. B\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch b\u1eb1ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Kindle mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1ea3ng ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ATR5divyToWjn0xewMhlGVQmgrh\"><strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Kindle c\u00f3 m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZNeBdprCHoBmWhxvtPJlI3Rqg4d\">Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n khi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed1n s\u00e1ch c\u00f3 t\u00ednh ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PZR8d7VCeocrr7xupU0lTBj6gNb\"><strong>T\u00f4i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp Kindle kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UUQTdaViRo2GiOxQQy6laOqxg1f\">C\u00f3. T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon v\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Kindle l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng mua h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng ch\u00ednh t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o Kindle.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-IOP7dlmQIojSlixhWhRlUhQ6gog\"><strong>T\u1ea1i sao t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng th\u00eam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ly0ndT5mvoBEpCxsqh2lngupgQg\">C\u00e1c l\u00fd do th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p bao g\u1ed3m: th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ebb (s\u1ed1 th\u1ebb, ng\u00e0y h\u1ebft h\u1ea1n, CVV) nh\u1eadp kh\u00f4ng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, th\u1ebb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t cho thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, ho\u1eb7c th\u1ebb \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ebft h\u1ea1n. H\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E78CdB9gMoLG28xNEgAlJ8ulgDb\">Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Kindle l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t quy tr\u00ecnh v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng. Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 m\u1edf ra c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t kho t\u00e0ng tri th\u1ee9c v\u00f4 t\u1eadn, n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 th\u1ee9 g\u00ec, \u1edf b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111\u00e2u. \u0110\u1eebng ch\u1ea7n ch\u1eeb, h\u00e3y t\u1ea1o ngay cho m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi s\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed \u0111\u1ea7y h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn ngay h\u00f4m nay!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RZDfd7oSpozU9OxFuT9liifqgwe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ce6PdYrNiol4VYxTGuOlHcwngEb\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFj2dIpO1olyrbxpL5Ml7Iyug6e\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GKR2dwa3foiZZZxTrmRlvDvjgKe\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O3R4d1FzioHiX1x7hfwlitxogcd\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ax8ad6MnCoYgtdxqultlwIDfgDe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IhNCdSg5Lo4IONxgCPylcDZdgWg\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Trong th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi s\u1ed1, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ecdc s\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i h\u01a1n bao gi\u1edd h\u1ebft nh\u1edd c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, v\u00e0 Amazon Kindle ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 c\u00e1i t\u00ean d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u xu h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u00e0y. Vi\u1ec7c s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Kindle l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5708,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"templ